WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.600
I don't have to tell you things
are bad. Everybody knows things
are bad. We're at war. People

00:06.600 --> 00:11.280
are out of work or scared of
losing their job. The dollar
buys a nickel's worth. Banks

00:11.280 --> 00:15.240
are going bust. Shopkeepers keep
a gun under the counter. Looters
are running wild in

00:15.240 --> 00:19.080
the street and there's nobody
anywhere who seems to know what
to do and there's no

00:19.080 --> 00:26.280
end to it. We know the air is
unfit to breathe. Our food is
unfit to eat. And we sit
watching

00:26.280 --> 00:31.280
our TVs while some local
newscaster tells us that today
we had 15 homicides and

00:31.280 --> 00:36.480
63 violent crimes if that's the
way it's supposed to be. We all
know things are

00:36.480 --> 00:42.360
bad. Worse than bad, they're
crazy. It's like everything
everywhere is going

00:42.360 --> 00:46.440
crazy. So we don't go out
anymore. We sit in the house and
slowly the world

00:46.440 --> 00:51.000
we're living in is getting
smaller. And all we say is
please at least leave us

00:51.000 --> 00:54.280
alone in our living rooms. Let
me have my cell phone and my TV
and my

00:54.280 --> 01:00.680
PlayStation. I won't say
anything. Just leave us alone.
Well, I'm not going to

01:00.680 --> 01:06.960
leave you alone. I want you to
get mad. I don't want you to
protest. I don't want

01:06.960 --> 01:10.040
you to riot. I don't want you to
write your congressman because I
wouldn't know

01:10.040 --> 01:13.480
what to tell you to write. I
don't know what to do about the
national

01:13.480 --> 01:16.520
debt and Katrina and the war on
terror and the crime in the
street. All I know

01:16.520 --> 01:21.760
is that first you've got to get
mad. You've got to say I'm a
human being.

01:21.800 --> 01:24.200
God damn it. My life has value.

01:26.200 --> 01:31.480
So I want you to get up now. I
want all of you to get up out of
your chairs. I want

01:31.480 --> 01:36.640
you to get right up now and go
to your laptop, microphone,
audacity, fire it up,

01:36.680 --> 01:42.240
stick it in your ear and yell.
I'm mad as hell. And I want to
quit my day job.

01:42.760 --> 01:45.880
Are you ready for the audition?
Step up and take it.

01:46.480 --> 01:48.080
podcho.com
